{"version":1,"content":"<p>據《WIRED》此前報道及生物科技公司Exin Therapeutics最新披露，OpenAI旗下AI模型GPT-6.1 Sol已被用於活體小鼠腦部手術實驗，並在連續三次操作中，通過外科醫生的反饋改善了定位表現。到第三次操作時，其識別關鍵解剖標誌的耗時從169秒縮短至86秒，定位誤差從0.6毫米降至0.3毫米。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585444.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.662533+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T07:46:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"e473c43d3c5826afab39c88192c68272183e8df515a8cf24dd04bf6b54e7ebf0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}